# Trivy ignore file. The Go source-build stage no longer ships its artifacts to
# the final image: kubeconform and kubesec are compiled in a throwaway
# go-builder stage, and kubectl/doctl/trivy/buildx are official release
# binaries. The former /tmp/unified-go-build and /go/pkg/mod test-fixture
# ignores therefore no longer apply and have been deleted.

# Base-image vulnerabilities we cannot control without breaking ARC
# compatibility. Tracked and risk-accepted in SECURITY-DISMISSALS.md.
CVE-2025-47907  # Container runtime tools in the actions-runner base image
